# With fewer than two cards the player discards what they have (CR 701.9b), and with none is asked nothing, yet the
# damage is still dealt. Bot2 plays out all but one card on its turn 2 (everything but Mox Sapphire costs {0}): the
# first Cruelty takes that lone card (asked, as a discard always is), the second finds an empty hand and asks no
# question (`! Bot2.Choose`), and each deals its 2 damage (20 - 4 = 16).

